subckt pll_inv_pdk110_51 (a y vdd vss)
MN (y a vss vss) nch w=1.2e-05 l=1.8e-07 nf=1 ad=5.76e-12 as=5.76e-12 pd=2.496e-05 ps=2.496e-05 nrd=0.0225 nrs=0.0225 sa=4.8e-07 sb=4.8e-07 sd=5.4e-07 sca=0 scb=0 scc=0
MP (y a vdd vdd) pch w=2e-06 l=1.8e-07 nf=1 ad=9.599999999999999e-13 as=9.599999999999999e-13 pd=4.96e-06 ps=4.96e-06 nrd=0.135 nrs=0.135 sa=4.8e-07 sb=4.8e-07 sd=5.4e-07 sca=0 scb=0 scc=0
